Description: Parallel and low-memory C++17/Rhtslib/Flat-CSR implementation
    (bambu_next) of bambu for multi-sample transcript discovery and
    quantification from long-read RNA-Seq data, preserving full Bioconductor
    SummarizedExperiment and GRangesList compatibility.
